Z||000000||CanadianGT||03-17-2001||11:54 PM||||I currently own a 86 GT, and I just recently bought a brand new T-top kit for it.  I live right outside Toronto, and I was wondering if anyone knows a place that has done this type of conversion before.  I took it to one body shop, and they said they would not install it.  I am also looking at doing a 3800 series 2 supercharged engine conversion,and was wondering if anyone knows how much a brand new crate engine costs.  I could not find it on the ACE sight, but maybe I just missed it. Someone mentioned to me I should get the conversion done at the Fiero shop here in T.O..  Has anyone had experience with them?<BR>Thanks <BR>Kyle||||reg||1
Z||000001||Jake||03-18-2001||03:37 AM||||Buddy of mine wanted T-tops put in his 85 2m6. Looked for a place to do it forever and never found one. I was always happy with my huge sun-roof myself  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>----------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Rxbw_1.jpg">  ||||reg||1
